-- FPS is under 15 or the target is a boss: one [PERF] line -- FPS, effect objects the game spawned per second, how many
-- are in workspace.Effects, Lua heap. FPS falling with a burst of spawned effects = the game's own effects (CPU, not
-- drawing); FPS falling with few effects = something else, the script included. Read-only.
