	-- a mob the walker found no path to 3 times in a row (up on a ledge it can't get onto, e.g. a
	-- Mini Bunny 126 studs over Floor 2): left alone for 90s instead of retried forever
	-- A mob well above / below us (more than 30 studs: up on a walkway, a ledge) is checked once
	-- with the pathfinder before we commit to it; no walking route -> skipped straight away (60s,
	-- then checked again). Without this, a whole group of Mini Bunnies on Floor 3's upper walkway
	-- was tried one at a time, 3 failed walks each, and the first came back after its 90s.
	-- NPCs in workspace.NPCs that count for "floor cleared" checks: everything except ImpelIgnore
